{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人劉沛蘅今年6月在家中遭遇意外，被一個從高處跌落、重約2至3公斤的獎座擊中頭部導致「爆缸」流血，需緊急送院縫針，幸無大礙。</p><p>經過不幸事件後，她重新出發出外旅行，並透過社交平台分享照片。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;見她穿上火辣</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:45:52.462862+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:24:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:24.567851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:24.567851+00:00","content_hash":"e3d053499ec0f2844439e72d2e55de98414f95b9c120707bc6a7a1883057bce5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}